# Files skipped when deploying from this machine with the `vercel` CLI.
# (Git-connected deploys build from the repo itself, so this file does not affect them.)
#
# IMPORTANT: every folder pattern starts with "/" so it only matches the repo root.
# Without the slash, `spark/` would also swallow src/pages/spark/ and `brand/` would
# swallow public/brand/ (the logo), which would break the site.

# Local-only work, raw media and scratch folders
/spark/
/spark-2026/
/design/
/brand/
/docs/
/scratch/

# Large photos are served from Cloudflare R2, never bundled (see CONTRIBUTING.md)
/public/crew/
/public/events/welcome-day-2026/

# Loose files in the project root (answer keys, specs, raw video)
/*.pdf
/*.MOV
/*.mp4

# Tooling state, build output and secrets
/dist/
/.astro/
/.claude/
/.vscode/
.env
.env.*
